    "description": "France Bed Holdings Co., Ltd., through its subsidiaries, provides medical services in Japan. The company operates in two segments, Medical Services Business, and Home Furnishing and Health Business. It engages in the manufacturing, procurement, rental, and retail/wholesale sale of medical and nursing care beds, as well as welfare equipment; supply of linen to medical and welfare facilities, as well as hotels; and provision of facility solutions for medical and welfare facilities. The company is also involved in the design of mattresses; operation of showrooms for product experience and sleep consultation; and supply of beds, mattresses, and related products to hotels, inns, and other lodging operators. In addition, it engages in the sale of sundries; exhibition sale of furniture, fashion, and jewelry; manufacturing and sale of assorted beds and beddings, as well as special needs and home health equipment; maintenance, inspection, and repair of nursing-care and special needs equipment; storage of products and control of inventory; long-term care insurance welfare equipment rental business; daily-life care services in specified facilities; communal living care services for elderly with dementia; rental housing for elderly; and home renovation for home care. The company was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in Shinjuku, Japan."
